msgstr "全部 :math:`c` 个分量一起"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:104
#: 71e53c694fe94a1ab78b08d2a192e937
msgid "vector field gradient (``gradu``)"
msgstr "向量场梯度（\\ ``gradu``\\ ）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:105
#: 7918c138d16e4b13acbeb983bab20a7d
msgid "``[c, D]``"
msgstr "``[c, D]``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:106
#: d098fc13a15b4b229e3a6c9cd809643c
msgid "the Jacobian: row :math:`i` is :math:`\\nabla u_i`"
msgstr "雅可比矩阵：第 :math:`i` 行是 :math:`\\nabla u_i`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:108
#: 462357c044d740e3a66584408400330a
msgid ""
"so ``gradu.diagonal().sum()`` is :math:`\\nabla\\cdot u`, ``(gradu * "
"gradv).sum()`` is :math:`\\nabla u : \\nabla v`, and ``(gradu @ w).dot(v)`` "
"is the convection term :math:`(w\\cdot\\nabla)u\\cdot v`. Only the arguments"
" you name are computed: a pass that touches neither field of a block is "
"skipped, so absent couplings (e.g. the zero pressure-pressure block of "
"Stokes) cost nothing beyond their sparsity-pattern slot."
msgstr ""
"因此 ``gradu.diagonal().sum()`` 是 :math:`\\nabla\\cdot u`\\ ，\\ ``(gradu * "
"gradv).sum()`` 是 :math:`\\nabla u : \\nabla v`\\ ，而 ``(gradu @ w).dot(v)`` "
"是对流项 :math:`(w\\cdot\\nabla)u\\cdot v`\\ "
"。仅计算你命名的参数：若某个分块的传递不涉及任何场，则跳过该分块，因此缺失的耦合（例如斯托克斯方程的压力-"
"压力零分块）除了稀疏模式中的占位外不产生任何开销。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:118
#: 7ea2fa2f911b4ecf94e96639ab9fd890
msgid ""
"The integrand must be **bilinear**: every term must contain exactly one "
"trial factor and one test factor. Internally each :math:`(\\alpha, \\beta)` "
"block is extracted by evaluating the integrand with the *other* fields "
"zeroed — an identity for bilinear forms, silently wrong otherwise. The "
"assembler guards this with a cheap zero-evaluation check and raises if your "
"integrand has a constant or non-bilinear part. Nonlinear weak forms are "
"handled the usual FEM way: linearize (Picard / Newton) and feed the previous"
" iterate in as *data*, e.g. the lagged convection velocity ``w`` below."
msgstr ""
"被积函数必须是\\ **双线性的**\\ ：每一项必须恰好包含一个试函数因子和一个检验函数因子。内部通过对\\ *其他*\\ 场置零来提取每个 "
":math:`(\\alpha, \\beta)` "
"分块——这对双线性形式是恒等操作，否则则是静默错误。装配器通过廉价的零求值检查来防范这一点，若被积函数含常数项或非双线性部分则抛出异常。非线性弱形式按有限元常规方式处理：线性化（皮卡/牛顿）并将前一次迭代作为\\"
" *数据*\\ 传入，例如下面滞后的对流速度 ``w``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:129
#: 82950896626744fb94bbb6a0f0bc63c5
msgid ""
"A Picard-linearized Navier-Stokes step, for example, adds one data argument "
"to the Stokes integrand (see :doc:`/example_gallery/fluid/cavity` for the "
"full script):"
msgstr ""
"例如，皮卡线性化的纳维-斯托克斯步在斯托克斯被积函数上增加一个数据参数（完整脚本参见 "
":doc:`/example_gallery/fluid/cavity`\\ ）："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:144
#: 30eb340df88f424da1fbb8e0bf20cb4f
msgid "Building and calling"
msgstr "构建与调用"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:146
#: 8fd3b9006617400f986213956ee8b0f9
msgid ""
":meth:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler.from_mesh` builds the assembler; "
"extra positional/keyword arguments go to your ``__post_init__`` (physical "
"parameters), exactly like the single-field assemblers:"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler.from_mesh` 构建装配器；额外的位置/关键字参数传给你的 "
"``__post_init__``\\ （物理参数），与单场装配器完全一致："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:156
#: 2630aab523794855abe03e3da4ff2dd3
msgid ""
"The default quadrature degree is ``2 * max(field orders)`` — exact for the "
"products of two highest-order basis functions on affine elements. Pass "
"``quadrature_order=`` to override (e.g. for data-weighted or convective "
"terms); the shipped tables go up to degree 7."
msgstr ""
"默认求积阶数为 ``2 * max(field orders)``——对仿射单元上两个最高阶基函数的乘积精确。传入 "
"``quadrature_order=`` 覆盖（例如用于数据加权项或对流项）；内置表最高到7阶。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:161
#: 41031962552f405798692d0dbc71c923
msgid ""
"The result is a square :class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix` of size "
":math:`N = \\sum_f n_f\\, c_f`. Repeated calls (Picard iterations, time "
"steps) reuse the same cached index tensors, so a "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` built once keeps its condensation layout "
"across calls."
msgstr ""
"结果是一个大小为 :math:`N = \\sum_f n_f\\, c_f` 的方阵 "
":class:`~tensormesh.sparse.SparseMatrix`\\ "
"。重复调用（皮卡迭代、时间步）复用相同的缓存索引张量，因此一次构建的 :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` "
"在多次调用间保持其凝聚布局不变。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:169
#: 448ae6e5a2c74196bee186ddb213f7ee
msgid ""
"Mixed assembly is currently **single-device**: the "
":func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed` decorator (:doc:`distributed`) "
"covers the single-field assemblers only. Distributing the block layout "
"across ranks needs a global DOF numbering layer that does not exist yet — it"
" is a planned ROADMAP item."
msgstr ""
"混合装配目前为\\ **单设备**\\ ：\\ :func:`~tensormesh.distributed.distributed` 装饰器（\\ "
":doc:`distributed`\\ ）仅覆盖单场装配器。跨进程分布分块布局需要尚不存在的全局自由度编号层——这是一项计划中的 ROADMAP "
"条目。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:180
#: 3bae233de22849ae8f74f836973aba21
msgid "The block DOF layout"
msgstr "分块自由度布局"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:182
#: 43f1f82134f84425bef3aeefdb667968
msgid ""
"The global DOF vector stacks the fields in declaration order, node-major "
"within each field:"
msgstr "全局自由度向量按声明顺序堆叠各场，每场内按节点优先："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:185
#: 3f1d8b3b1c2a49d0baf4ca4df078f930
msgid ""
"\\mathrm{dof} \\;=\\; \\mathrm{offset}_f + n_{\\mathrm{local}}\\cdot c_f + "
"\\mathrm{comp}."
msgstr ""
"\\mathrm{dof} \\;=\\; \\mathrm{offset}_f + n_{\\mathrm{local}}\\cdot c_f + "
"\\mathrm{comp}."

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:189
#: 359222dbe8e149ceb6d078f0ccff9d66
msgid ""
"You never index this by hand — ``assembler.layout`` (a "
":class:`~tensormesh.BlockLayout`) provides the vocabulary:"
msgstr ""
"你无需手动索引——``assembler.layout``\\ （一个 :class:`~tensormesh.BlockLayout`\\ "
"）提供了相关操作："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:214
#: 614bb71bef214dd096718524d1bebb8e
msgid ""
"Boundary conditions then go through the **unchanged** "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` — a mixed system is just a bigger DOF vector "
"with a boolean mask:"
msgstr ""
"边界条件则通过\\ **不变的** :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` 施加——混合系统只是一个更大的带布尔掩码的自由度向量："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:230
#: a347262000294d7181cff2607f17b275
msgid ""
"``boundary_mask`` detects the boundary **topologically** (a facet referenced"
" by exactly one cell), so it also works for meshes without ``is_boundary`` "
"point data — e.g. gmsh imports — and for generalized-order fields whose DOFs"
" are not mesh nodes."
msgstr ""
"``boundary_mask`` 通过\\ **拓扑方式**\\ 检测边界（仅被一个单元引用的面），因此它也适用于没有 ``is_boundary``"
" 点数据的网格——例如 gmsh 导入的网格——以及自由度不是网格节点的广义阶次场。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:239
#: cd2fbf96b77c441fb75c3375114f7d2b
msgid "Load vectors"
msgstr "载荷向量"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:241
#: a4359e5fb9ff44a9bbace08926e9c491
msgid ""
":meth:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler.assemble_vector` is the linear form"
" :math:`l(v)` of the mixed space: same dispatch, **test arguments only**, "
"output a dense ``[N]`` vector in the same block layout. Override "
"``forward_vector`` for the \"natural\" RHS of the problem, or pass a one-off"
" ``func=``:"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler.assemble_vector` 是混合空间的线性形式 "
":math:`l(v)`\\ ：相同的分发机制，\\ **仅测试参数**\\ ，输出相同块布局的稠密 ``[N]`` "
"向量。为问题的\"自然\"右端项重写 ``forward_vector``\\ ，或传入一次性 ``func=``\\ ："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:267
#: 6c22a45598ce41edaf910dd78e9713b9
msgid ""
"Because the load is integrated **in each field's own space**, sources on a "
"generalized-order field are consistent by construction — no manual "
"interpolation between spaces."
msgstr "由于载荷在\\ **每个场自身的空间**\\ 中积分，广义阶次场上的源项按构造就是协调的——无需在之间手动插值。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:275
#: 9fc06d168ac34057afc9cc2510df4554
msgid "Data channels"
msgstr "数据通道"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:277
#: 0f574a075a9244938083e2286093b023
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"All the single-field channels work in ``forward`` / ``forward_vector`` — "
"``x``, ``point_data`` (interpolated with the mesh-order basis, ``grad{key}``"
" available), ``element_data``, ``scalar_data`` — plus one new channel:"
msgstr ""
"所有单场通道在 ``forward`` / ``forward_vector`` 中均可用——``x``\\ 、\\ ``point_data``\\ "
"（以网格阶次基函数插值，\\ ``grad{key}`` 可用）、\\ ``element_data``\\ 、\\ "
"``scalar_data``——外加一个新通道："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:282
#: 930764c65e034dc389b2fabf1c0f971e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``field_data={\"name\": (field, values)}``"
msgstr "``field_data={\"name\": (field, values)}``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:283
#: bca6a3a6d1b4446ca3ea473606da3856
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Data living on a **field's own DOFs**, interpolated with that field's basis "
"(``grad{name}`` available too). This is the channel for Picard / time "
"stepping on generalized-order fields: the previous iterate of a topological "
"P2 velocity has no mesh-point representation, so it must ride on its own DOF"
" vector:"
msgstr ""
"数据位于\\ **场自身的自由度**\\ 上，以该场的基函数插值（\\ ``grad{name}`` 也可用）。这是用于 Picard / "
"时间步进在广义阶次场上的通道：拓扑 P2 速度的前一次迭代没有网格点表示，因此必须承载于自身的自由度向量："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:294
#: f9486ea28c614ad9be7ead516ac1d50c
msgid ""
"On a mesh whose order equals the field order the two channels agree — "
"``point_data`` is then the simpler spelling."
msgstr "当网格阶次等于场阶次时，两个通道一致——此时 ``point_data`` 是更简单的写法。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:301
#: 0d252beb7177443587f62b5fb145efa5
msgid "Generalized order pairs"
msgstr "广义阶次配对"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:303
#: deb879a2843745f7adac84a2875b5b10
msgid ""
"Field orders are **not** tied to the mesh order. Besides order 1 and the "
"mesh order (whose DOFs sit on mesh nodes), any other order builds a "
"*topological Lagrange DOF map*: one DOF per vertex, :math:`k-1` per unique "
"(oriented) edge, plus cell interiors. In practice this means:"
msgstr ""
"场阶次\\ **不**\\ 绑定于网格阶次。除阶次 1 和网格阶次（其自由度位于网格节点）外，任何其他阶次都会构建一个\\ "
"*拓扑拉格朗日自由度映射*\\ ：每个顶点一个自由度，每条唯一（定向）边 :math:`k-1` 个，加上单元内部。实际意味着："

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:308
#: 6c8443db48f84a3582070cfa56ad1e2a
msgid ""
"**Taylor-Hood on a linear gmsh mesh.** A ``Field(order=2)`` on an imported "
"P1 mesh creates the quadratic space topologically — no re-meshing at order "
"2. The :doc:`cylinder flow </example_gallery/fluid/cylinder_flow>` and "
":doc:`flow past obstacles </example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles>` examples "
"run exactly this way."
msgstr ""
"**线性 gmsh 网格上的 Taylor-Hood。** 在导入的 P1 网格上，\\ ``Field(order=2)`` "
"拓扑地创建二次空间——无需在阶次 2 重新划分网格。\\ :doc:`圆柱绕流 "
"</example_gallery/fluid/cylinder_flow>` 和 :doc:`障碍物绕流 "
"</example_gallery/fluid/flow_obstacles>` 示例正是以这种方式运行。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:314
#: 8592a4fe79664f88be229c16dc359931
msgid ""
"**Higher pairs.** P3-P2 and beyond work the same; edge DOFs are stored on "
"*oriented* edges so adjacent elements agree and the spaces stay "
":math:`C^0`-conforming at any order."
msgstr ""
"**更高阶配对。** P3-P2 及更高阶同理；边自由度存储在\\ *定向*\\ 边上，因此相邻单元一致，空间在任意阶次保持 :math:`C^0` "
"协调。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:317
#: 39bea69b6168442dba2ae2ec97e62003
msgid ""
"**Geometry stays isoparametric at the mesh order.** A P2 field on a curved "
"(order-2) mesh integrates on the curved geometry even when paired with a P1 "
"pressure; sub- and super-parametric fields are both correct."
msgstr ""
"**几何始终保持网格阶次的等参数。** P2 场在弯曲（阶次 2）网格上积分时即使与 P1 压力配对也使用弯曲几何；次参数和超参数场都是正确的。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:322
#: 8d93bd7c18ac4933b43ad485804c857a
msgid ""
"Current limits, checked with explicit errors: in 3D the topological map "
"covers vertex + edge DOFs (tetra P2 works; orders needing face DOFs raise "
"``NotImplementedError``), and the quadrature tables stop at degree 7 — about"
" P3-P2 in practice."
msgstr ""
"当前限制，以显式错误检查：三维中拓扑映射覆盖顶点 + 边自由度（四面体 P2 可用；需要面自由度的阶次会抛出 "
"``NotImplementedError``\\ ），求积表止于 7 次——实际约 P3-P2。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/mixed_assembly.rst:327
#: 4c15f0ba8d8c45cb979bdcb1a6d63d0a
msgid ""
"For fields with topological DOFs, ``layout.node_ids`` (a mesh-node concept) "
"is unavailable; use ``layout.points(name)``, ``layout.boundary_mask(name)`` "
"and ``layout.dof_mask(name, where=...)``, which work for every field kind, "
"and move data with ``layout.prolong`` / ``layout.restrict`` (isoparametric "
"interpolation)."
msgstr ""
"对于拓扑自由度场，\\ ``layout.node_ids``\\ （网格节点概念）不可用；请使用 ``layout.points(name)``\\ "
"、\\ ``layout.boundary_mask(name)`` 和 ``layout.dof_mask(name, where=...)``\\ "
"，它们适用于每种场类型，并用 ``layout.prolong`` / ``layout.restrict``\\ （等参数插值）传输数据。"

